00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:18.970
métiers réels

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:19.750
sans les plier

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.090
aux limites de la technologie.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:22.330
Pourtant,

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:23.290
des voies expérimentées

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:23.970
